Why does it matter?
A2UI solves the “Chat Wall” problem — the tedious back-and-forth where an agent asks you five separate questions to book a table. With A2UI, the agent simply pops up a form with a date picker and time slots, letting you finish the task in seconds.

Key Features of A2UI
Security First: Because the agent sends data (JSON) and not code (JavaScript), it cannot “hack” your app. It can only use UI components (like “Button” or “TextField”) that you have already approved in a trusted catalog.
Native Look & Feel: The interface doesn’t look like a clunky embedded website. Since your app does the actual rendering, the AI-generated buttons match your app’s specific brand, colors, and fonts perfectly.
Cross-Platform: An agent can send the same JSON message to a website, an iPhone app, or a Windows desktop app. Each platform “translates” that JSON into its own native language (React, Flutter, SwiftUI, etc.).
Streaming & Fast: A2UI uses a “flat” structure, meaning the AI can start showing you the top of a form while it’s still “thinking” about the bottom. This makes the UI feel instant and responsive.
